<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-SAUDI ARABIA BEAT UAE 4-2 ON PENALTIES TO WIN ASIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SAUDI ARABIA BEAT UAE 4-2 ON PENALTIES TO WIN ASIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia won the Asian Cup</p>
<p>when they beat hosts the United Arab Emirates 4-2 on penalties</p>
<p>after the final ended goalless after extra time on Saturday.</p>
</text>
